# These two values are public by design. NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the browser
# bundle at build time, so both are served to every visitor of the deployed site
# whether or not they live in this file. The anon key grants nothing on its own —
# every table is behind row-level security and what it can read depends entirely
# on who is signed in. The service-role key is the secret one, and it is not here
# and is not used by this app.
